#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_average_unit_price
msgid ""
"If linked to a lot, takes the lot's average unit price "
"(quant.lot_id.average_price).Otherwise, uses the product's last purchase "
"price (quant.product_id.last_purchase_price)."
msgstr ""
"Si está vinculado a un lote, toma el precio unitario medio del lote "
"(quant.lot_id.average_price). De lo contrario, utiliza el último precio de "
"compra del producto (quant.product_id.last_purchase_price)."

#. module: stock_quant_valuation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_quant_valuation.field_stock_quant__lot_purchase_cost
msgid ""
"If linked to a lot, takes the lot's purchase cost "
"(quant.lot_id.purchase_cost). Otherwise, uses the product's last purchase "
"price (quant.product_id.last_purchase_price)."
msgstr ""
"Si está vinculado a un lote, toma el coste de compra del lote (quant.lot_id.purchase_cost). "
"De lo contrario, utiliza el último precio de compra del producto "
"(quant.product_id.last_purchase_price)."

